# Terraform (Phase 9)
# Provider binaries — 600MB+, re-created by `terraform init`.
terraform/.terraform/
# State names every resource that exists, and can contain secret values in
# plain text. Local state is a deliberate choice for a 3-day burst cluster
# (see terraform/versions.tf); committing it would not be.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed on purpose: it pins provider versions so
# every apply resolves the same code.

# Personal working notes — kept locally, not part of the deliverable.
#
# These describe how the project was BUILT (prep material, review plans, phase
# checklists, the working agreement I wrote for Claude) rather than what it
# does. The repo's own docs — README, docs/EKS.md, docs/GITOPS.md,
# docs/MIGRATIONS.md, docs/BACKUP_RESTORE.md, docs/IMAGES.md — are the
# deliverable and stay tracked.
#
# NOTE: ignoring a path does not untrack it. These were removed from the index
# with `git rm --cached`, which leaves them on disk and stops future changes
# being staged. They remain in git HISTORY; scrubbing that needs a rewrite.
docs/interview-prep.md
docs/K8S_INTERVIEW_PREP.md
docs/review-findings-plan.md
docs/K8S_PHASE1_CHECKLIST.md

# Working agreements / prompt specs for Claude Code.
vesselmind-k8s-CLAUDE.md
*claude-code-prompt-*.md
CLAUDE.md
